    "1. Say to your AI: \"Run tool:stitch-facts-into-people\", and give it facts, config.",
    "2. The AI calls run_resource_operation at @workshop-tools with method tools:run, tool tool:stitch-facts-into-people and its input (the worked example shows one).",
